     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "A municipal project",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "町 の 図書館 を どこ に 建てる か、長い 間 意見 が 分かれていた。",
       "alumno": "For a long time there were divided opinions about where to build the neighbourhood library.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "駅 の 近く は 便利 だが、土地 の 値段 が 高い。",
       "alumno": "Near the station it's convenient, but the land is expensive.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "公園 の となり を 選ぶ 人 も いた ものの、近所 の 人 は 静かな 場所 を 守りたい と 考えた。",
       "alumno": "Although some people chose the area next to the park, the neighbours wanted to protect a quiet place.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "何度も 話し合った あげく、古い 学校 を 直して 使う こと に なった。",
       "alumno": "After discussing it many times, they finally decided to repair and use the old school.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "時間 は かかった が、みんな の 意見 を 聞いた だけに、今 の 場所 に 満足している 人 が 多い。",
       "alumno": "It took time, but since everyone's opinions were heard, many people are satisfied with the chosen place.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
